  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>注意：</strong>&nbsp;该资源包仍在开发中（WIP），未来会陆续加入更多 Blackout 纹理（例如在获得附加组件支持后）。</p>\n<p><strong>目前支持的附加组件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2-wireless-terminals\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2WLIB</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ex-pattern-provider\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended AE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-flux\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Flux</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-import-export-card\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 Import Export Card</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mega-cells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MEGA Cells</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancedae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdvancedAE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/merequester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ME Requester</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appliede\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppliedE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-ae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded AE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-network-analyser\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 Network Analyser</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-energistique\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars &Eacute;nergistique</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Generators</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bigger-ae2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bigger AE2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-experienced\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Experienced</a><br><br>\n<p><strong>免责声明</strong></p>\n<p>这些纹理大部分并非我原创，而是源自&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2 (AE2)</a>&nbsp;与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ae2-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 Dark Mode</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如有需要，请在 Discord 上联系我：void_odyssey</p>\n<p><strong>功能特性</strong></p>\n<p>将 AE2 及其附加组件中的大部分纹理替换为暗黑模式风格。<br>此外，新风格的暗黑模式纹理也已反向移植至 1.20.1 版本。</p>\n<p>方块变更</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pVTtfsS.png\" alt=\"*方块变更*\" width=\"1148\" height=\"914\"></p>\n<p>物品变更</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tsRQwTh.png\" alt=\"*物品变更*\" width=\"1296\" height=\"729\"></p>",
